<div class="about-content">
	<h3 class="about">ABOUT</h3>
	<p class="about-description">
		Hello everyone, thank you for allowing me to introduce myself, my name is Herschelle Libradilla I am 21 years old, I am from
		Philippines Cebu, Pardo pob.
		I’m a back-end developer who loves exploring and learning as technology continues to 
		evolve. Problem-solving is where I feel most at home, and I enjoy building websites 
		and systems that make life easier for people and businesses. I’m genuinely excited to
		keep growing in this field and to take on real-world projects that challenge me and push 
		my skills further. My current focus is on the C# programming language, which I use the most 
		and enjoy working with. I’m continuously improving my knowledge—there are still many things in
		C# I haven’t mastered yet, but that’s exactly what motivates me. I’m also learning ASP.NET Core, 
		a framework I’ve grown to love because of how powerful and flexible it is for modern web development. 
		Beyond back-end work, I’m interested in building full web applications and expanding my skills across
		different layers of development. Even when the learning curve gets tough, I stay consistent, committed, and curious.
		I’m the type of programmer who keeps going, keeps improving, and keeps pushing toward better solutions.
	</p>
